{"v":4,"catch":"一座城市。一名戰士。問題太多了。","desc":"在《城市攤牌》中，拳頭說話，街道不等待。踏入一場像素風格的戰鬥，每條小巷都是戰場，每場戰鬥都是個人的。\n\n沒有規則。沒有休息。只是一波又一波憤怒的傢伙、裝滿驚喜的垃圾桶和一座希望你失望的城市。但你來這裡不是為了公平競爭——你來這裡是為了奪回整個街區。\n\n準備好清理街道了嗎？開始擺動。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2025-05-01","genres":["街機","動作","格鬥"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/53905c7f173861d6fb5c2c081759a2c8c9e16f99b01c9083813248cf650a0d06.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb24a6337f122eeb18bfac5b2f2e2f6269e56423c1c2c3fe05ebfeaee0c0b662.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/10d34438d6db134da345fa9f7c63f101dcd07af83fa6ca675887c0fe423a6587.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b594c97d20a065e4101c37520a2c55e19e3efbbae6d28ec18b92af7fc464ab0d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d59538be20721aa51a18e4743d263c3c84faf2b6dff959bd99022eb19fe824b9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26094dcdba2ae6795b18510dffb482445d3d3156055cd2b60331049fcf6dcd34.jpg"],"titleId":"0100df5023174000","dlc":[]}